WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:05.260
If you find your stitch
symbols palette, empty it's

2
00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:09.860
because somehow the font file
that displays the symbols on the screen

3
00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:13.620
has gotten erased or
corrupted on your computer.

4
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:15.860
There's an easy fix.

5
00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:19.460
Go from this to this.

6
00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:23.100
First, download this file to a folder

7
00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:26.100
on your computer where it
will be easy to to find.

8
00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.860
You can just stick it on your
desktop if you'd like.

9
00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:33.720
Once it's installed, you can
erase it from your desktop.

10
00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:39.260
2. Go to your Windows
search box and type FONTS.

11
00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:44.920
3. A listing of the fonts
on your machine will display.

12
00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:51.540
4. Drag the file that you downloaded
and drop it into that fonts folder.

13
00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:54.100
5. Close DesignaKnit and any other

14
00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:57.700
Windows you have open
and restart your computer.

15
00:00:57.730 --> 00:00:59.500
When you open DesignaKnit,

16
00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:02.560
the fonts will be correctly
displayed and you'll be good to go.

